19	\N	3	\N	\N	1	\N	6	\N	\N	1	1	\N	discuss.channel	comment	"Marc Demo" <mark.brown23@example.com>	\N	\N	<034264791459248.1779342849.285659313201904-openerp-3-discuss.channel@at-desk-02>	"Marc Demo" <mark.brown23@example.com>	\N	<p>Selling a training session and selling the products after the training session is more efficient than directly selling a pack with the training session and the products.</p>	\N	\N	\N	t	2026-05-16 05:54:00	\N	2026-05-21 05:54:04.21157	2026-05-21 05:54:04.21157
20	\N	3	\N	\N	1	\N	2	\N	\N	1	1	\N	discuss.channel	comment	"OdooBot" <odoobot@example.com>	\N	\N	<061891981686434.1779342849.293973684310913-openerp-3-discuss.channel@at-desk-02>	"OdooBot" <odoobot@example.com>	\N	<p>I noted I can not manage efficiently my pipeline when I have more than 50 opportunities in the qualification stage.</p><p>Any advice on this? How do you organize your activities with more than 50 opportunities?</p>	\N	\N	\N	t	2026-05-17 05:54:00	\N	2026-05-21 05:54:04.21157	2026-05-21 05:54:04.21157
21	20	3	\N	\N	1	\N	6	\N	\N	1	1	\N	discuss.channel	comment	"Marc Demo" <mark.brown23@example.com>	\N	\N	<429731540703594.1779342849.299597978591919-openerp-3-discuss.channel@at-desk-02>	"Marc Demo" <mark.brown23@example.com>	\N	<p>When I have too much opportunities in the pipe, I start communicating with prospects more by email than phonecalls.</p><p>I send an email to create a sense of emergency, like <i>"can I call you this week about our quote?"</i> and I call only those that answer this email.</p><p>You can use the email template feature of Odoo to automate email composition.</p>	\N	\N	\N	t	2026-05-18 05:54:00	\N	2026-05-21 05:54:04.21157	2026-05-21 05:54:04.21157
